{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49500","headline":"虞美人 五 · 顾敻","name":"虞美人 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深闺春色劳思想，恨共春芜长。\n黄鹂娇转泥芳妍，杏枝如画倚轻烟，锁窗前。\n凭阑愁立双蛾细，柳影斜摇砌。\n玉郎还是不还家，教人魂梦逐杨花，绕天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}